    "q-223906": {
      "dom_id": "step-q223906",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "The reciprocal of $\\frac{1}{2}$ is{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "To find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{2}{1}\n$$\n\nNow, we simplify:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{1}=2\n$$\n\nSo, the reciprocal of $\\frac{1}{2}$ is $2.$",
