      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "What is the reciprocal of $\\frac{5}{4}?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{5}{4}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{4}{5}\n$$\n\nSo the reciprocal of $\\frac{5}{4}$ is $\\frac{4}{5}.$",
