></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 1em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2192\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 1em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mstyle space=\"4\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>5</mn></mstyle><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mn>4</mn></mstyle></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mn>4</mn></mstyle><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>5</mn></mstyle></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>So the reciprocal of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"16\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><