      "problem": "The reciprocal of $\\frac{13}{6}$ is{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "To find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{13}{6}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{6}{13}\n$$\n\nSo, the reciprocal of $\\frac{13}{6}$ is $\\frac{6}{13}.$",
