      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "What is the reciprocal of $\\frac{15}{8}?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{15}{8}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{8}{15}\n$$\n\nSo the reciprocal of $\\frac{15}{8}$ is $\\frac{8}{15}.$",
