    "q-223914": {
      "dom_id": "step-q223914",
      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "Expressed as a mixed number in its lowest terms, the reciprocal of $\\frac{7}{10}$ is{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "To find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{7}{10}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{10}{7}\n$$\n\nNow, we convert the resulting fraction to a mixed number:\n\n$$\n10÷7=1\\,\\text{R}\\,3=1\\,\\frac{3}{7}\n$$\n\nSo, the reciprocal of $\\frac{7}{10}$ is $1\\,\\frac{3}{7}.$",
