      "kp_id": "e-13734"
    },
    "q-92708": {
      "dom_id": "step-q92708",
      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "What is the reciprocal of $\\frac{6}{25}?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{6}{25}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{25}{6}\n$$\n\nNow, we convert the resulting fraction to a mixed number:\n\n$$\n25÷6=4\\,\\text{R}1=4\\,\\frac{1}{6}\n$$\n\nSo the reciprocal of $\\frac{6}{25}$ is $4\\,\\frac{1}{6}.$",
