    "q-57210": {
      "dom_id": "step-q57210",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "What is the reciprocal of $\\frac{6}{17}?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{6}{17}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{17}{6}\n$$\n\nNow, we convert the resulting fraction to a mixed number:\n\n$$\n17÷6=2\\,\\text{R}5=2\\,\\frac{5}{6}\n$$\n\nSo the reciprocal of $\\frac{6}{17}$ is $2\\,\\frac{5}{6}.$",
