      "name": "Question 12",
      "problem": "What is the reciprocal of $35?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we write $35$ as a fraction:\n\n$$\n35=\\frac{35}{1}\n$$\n\nTo find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{35}{1}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{1}{35}\n$$\n\nSo the reciprocal of $35$ is $\\frac{1}{35}.$",
