      "name": "Question 13",
      "problem": "What is the reciprocal of $19?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we write $19$ as a fraction:\n\n$$\n19=\\frac{19}{1}\n$$\n\nTo find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{19}{1}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{1}{19}\n$$\n\nSo the reciprocal of $19$ is $\\frac{1}{19}.$",
