      "name": "Question 15",
      "problem": "The reciprocal of $25$ is{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "First, we write $25$ as a fraction:\n\n$$\n25=\\frac{25}{1}\n$$\n\nTo find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{25}{1}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{1}{25}\n$$\n\nSo, the reciprocal of $25$ is $\\frac{1}{25}.$",
