    "q-57043": {
      "dom_id": "step-q57043",
      "name": "Question 16",
      "problem": "What is the reciprocal of $1\\,\\frac{4}{5}?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we convert the given mixed number to an improper fraction:\n\n$$\n1\\,\\frac{4}{5}=\\frac{(1\\times 5)+4}{5}=\\frac{9}{5}\n$$\n\nTo find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{9}{5}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{5}{9}\n$$\n\nSo the reciprocal of $\\frac{9}{5}$ is $\\frac{5}{9}.$",
