      "dom_id": "step-q99859",
      "name": "Question 18",
      "problem": "What is the reciprocal of $1\\,\\frac{2}{3}?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we convert the given mixed number to an improper fraction:\n\n$$\n1\\,\\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{(1\\times 3)+2}{3}=\\frac{5}{3}\n$$\n\nTo find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{5}{3}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{3}{5}\n$$\n\nSo the reciprocal of $\\frac{5}{3}$ is $\\frac{3}{5}.$",
