    "q-223951": {
      "dom_id": "step-q223951",
      "name": "Question 20",
      "problem": "The reciprocal of $1\\,\\frac{7}{8}$ is{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "First, we convert the given mixed number to an improper fraction:\n\n$$\n1\\,\\frac{7}{8}=\\frac{(1\\times 8)+7}{8}=\\frac{15}{8}\n$$\n\nTo find the reciprocal of a fraction, we switch the numerator and the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\frac{15}{8}\\,\\to \\,\\frac{8}{15}\n$$\n\nSo, the reciprocal of $1\\frac{7}{8}$ is $\\frac{8}{15}.$",
